  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Impementation of Assisted Voluntary Returns including Reintegration Measures and Operation of Open Center in the Perfecture of Attica for Applicants of Voluntary Return</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will to enable 16,500 (5,500 per year) third country nationals to travel in a safe and organized manner from Greece to their final destination in their country of origin and to accommodate 3,240 (1,080 per year) applicants for assisted voluntary return in the Open Center for Applicants of Voluntary Return and to support 4,350 (1,450 per year) returnees in their reintegration process.</narrative>
  </description>
